{"title":"1998 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the diagram <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/0/5f0f836008bd1f4b664fc2739132bb7ce20ea9b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DA = CB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"84\" height=\"14\" />. What is the measure of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/d/2fd7ff236155948285f42c13fc857fcae000db48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle DAC$\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" />?\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/d/5fd1da380b0391f2366701b3697a7fbeb8ecc730.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 70^{\\circ} \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 100^{\\circ} \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 95^{\\circ} \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 125^{\\circ} \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 110^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"499\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can use the fact that the sum of the interior angles in a triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/0/3f0cd95f95238159d02dbcea0aca632c2928991c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"37\" height=\"15\" />, which gives us:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/e/75e0dcc0df4da0c37c83f79a463f17fe3019903b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle CAB + 70 + 55 = 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"206\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/f/2bfea6c99c0cd205e3b0f7d9eafb4709b94ff591.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle CAB + 125 = 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"174\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0af814cf1eda7dfbd7dfb36d6488220da97d503.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle CAB = 55^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"123\" height=\"15\" />\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/a/baa909bc50e0ee9436942e28add70f9f02cc935c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle CAB$\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/0/510e2cf258111f88acfbceaeced6b3485f6b6569.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle ABC$\" width=\"71\" height=\"13\" /> in triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/7/b778c7410c4513a2c6d40ae98d26568e52286f65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC = CB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"83\" height=\"14\" />. However, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/0/5f0f836008bd1f4b664fc2739132bb7ce20ea9b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DA = CB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"84\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/8/2587a5c3ebc11948174a1b555026c1fd5c168900.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DA = AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"83\" height=\"14\" /> from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Transitive_property\" title=\"Transitive property\">transitive property</a>. \n</p><p>This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/0/a70bd93370700aad56c71a3ce2057cd13cea9552.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle ACD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"74\" height=\"14\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/9/63990dea8b05e3d203cf1e0a571bcf5529237b03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle CDA = 40^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"124\" height=\"15\" /> in triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/e/6ce2cd123db24a7b8373999aea7a98927e3b3c81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ACD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Using the sum of the interior angles in a triangle, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/4/b44fad8343ca41c741cf4dfe33ad769b0c371470.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle DAC + 40 + 40 = 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"206\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/e/1ee5ee9279917b54413544b8a06239bcad1f2d85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle DAC + 80 = 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"166\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/c/21cbe04b81bc54fb599f7fbaf65696165f1bfd56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\angle DAC = \\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } 100^{\\circ}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"179\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017191831\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 80/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 965/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3590/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    9.314      1 -total\n 71.56%    6.665      3 Template:Image_needed\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:32669:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017191831 and revision id 251870. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}